<title>MOROCCO: Morocco's BNDE bank profits up in 1996.</title>
<headline>Morocco's BNDE bank profits up in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moroccan Banque Nationale pour le Developpement Economique said on Monday it posted net profits of 75 million dirhams ($8 million) in 1996 from 64.5 million dirhams the previous year.</p>
<p>Turnover for 1996 stood at 915 million dirhams from 867 million dirhams in 1995.</p>
<p>The state is expected to sell 34.57 percent of its BNDE stake by end of June 1997.</p>
<p>The share traded at 229 dirhams on March 28.</p>
<p>($1=9.3 dirhams)</p>
</text>
